<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Electronics in India communications venture.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Electronics in India communications venture.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Electronics Co Ltd, an unlisted unit of the Hyundai Group, said on Wednesday it will invest $43 million in a satellite communications joint venture in India.</p>
<p>A company statement said that India-based Thapar Group and Pertech Computer will participate in the venture, which will be named Globalstar India Satellite Service.</p>
<p>Service is expected to begin in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
